WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.846
In this video, you will finish your contest.

00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:08.337
You will check the results, close voting, and announce the winners, and see what everyone else sees.

00:00:08.337 --> 00:00:09.424
We start on the map.

00:00:10.326 --> 00:00:12.075
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.858 --> 00:00:16.375
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.125
Then tap Allow.

00:00:22.378 --> 00:00:25.067
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.262
See the three dots?

00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:30.565
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:30.565 --> 00:00:31.103
Tap them.

00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:34.523
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.195 --> 00:00:41.293
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:00:41.996 --> 00:00:42.913
Tap Mine.

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:46.370
This is your personal page.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.554
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:52.262 --> 00:00:54.331
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:56.142 --> 00:00:59.555
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:00.255 --> 00:01:03.586
When voting is over, it is time to announce the winners.

00:01:03.586 --> 00:01:04.287
Tap Results.

00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:11.048
This shows who would win if you announced today, in every category, so there are no surprises.

00:01:11.954 --> 00:01:15.154
Tap Download results to save everything to a spreadsheet.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.972
It is a good idea to keep a copy for your records.

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:23.838
When you are ready, tap Close voting and announce winners.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.671
It asks you to tap again, because this cannot be undone.

00:01:30.574 --> 00:01:36.106
Once you confirm, the results are saved and locked, and everyone who entered is emailed.

00:01:36.106 --> 00:01:38.468
Winners get a congratulations message.

00:01:39.371 --> 00:01:42.593
To see what everyone else sees, tap See it as voters do.

00:01:44.655 --> 00:01:46.994
Here are the winners, with their awards.

00:01:46.994 --> 00:01:52.868
Winning homes keep a crown on the map and in their owners' profiles, so the recognition lasts all year.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.174
Next up: Read your contest activity.
